# Notepad: Backspace and Delete joining lines, Undo from the Edit menu (twice: undo of the undo)
# Reference: real 3.11 Notepad typing the same keys (arch311-ref/scn/edit-bs.scn, frames shots/edit-bs);
# frames where 3.11 only moved the caret are merged by the recorder, so some shots have none.
# regress: sh tools/run-app-test.sh apps/build/notepad "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: edit-bs/02.png 01.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: edit-bs/03.png 02.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: edit-bs/04.png 03.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: edit-bs/05.png 04.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: edit-bs/06.png 05.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: edit-bs/07.png 06.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
sleep 400
key a
key b
key c
key enter
key d
key e
key f
key home
key bs
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/01.png
key enter
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/02.png
key up
key end
key del
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/03.png
key alt
key e
key u
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/04.png
key x
key y
key bs
key bs
key bs
sleep 400
shot shots/05.png
key alt
key e
key u
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/06.png
quit
